  "type": "numerical",
  "level": 1,
  "question": {
    "text": "A particle is moving with constant acceleration <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>a</mi><mo>.</mo></math> Following graph shows <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msup><mi>v</mi><mn>2</mn></msup></math> versus&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>x</mi></math>&nbsp;(displacement) plot. The acceleration of the particle is _________&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">m</mi><mo>&#160;</mo><msup><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">s</mi><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>2</mn></mrow></msup><mo>.</mo></math><br /><img src=\"https://cdn-question-pool.getmarks.app/pyq/jee_main/5d116fb9-0d7e-4876-9360-d86d002eae15-image.png\" style=\"width: 280px; height: 245px;\" />",
    "image": null
  },
  "options": [],
  "correctValue": "1",
  "solution": {
    "text": "The equation of the straight&nbsp;line,&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>y</mi><mo>=</mo><mi>m</mi><mi>x</mi><mo>+</mo><mi>c</mi></math>, from the above graph we get the equation,&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msup><mi>v</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>=</mo><mn>2</mn><mi>x</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>20</mn></math>, now differentiate it with respect to&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>x</mi></math>,&nbsp;<br /><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><mn>2</mn><mi>v</mi><mfrac><mrow><mi>d</mi><mi>v</mi></mrow><mrow><mi>d</mi><mi>x</mi></mrow></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mn>2</mn><mo>&#8658;</mo><mi>a</mi><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mn>2</mn><mn>2</mn></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>&#160;</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">m</mi><mo>&#160;</mo><msup><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">s</mi><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>2</mn></mrow></msup></math>.",
    "image": null
  },
